{"seq":1,"slug":"esg-risk-taxonomy-scoring","title":"供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分（强迫劳动/森林砍伐/冲突矿产/碳）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/esg-risk-taxonomy-scoring","wordCount":2792,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应链-esg-风险分类与分级评分-强迫劳动-森林砍伐-冲突矿产-碳\">供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分（强迫劳动/森林砍伐/冲突矿产/碳）</h1><p>这家跨境电商的采购系统里，「ESG 风险」被三种东西共用：合规法务说的是 UFLPA 实体清单命中，可持续发展团队说的是 Scope 3 碳排放强度，供应链质量团队说的是某二级供应商的工伤率。它们回答同一类问题——「这条采购链路会不会出事」——但用四套互不通约的坐标系。分类先把四类风险拆开，评分把它们压进一个可排序、可设阈值、可驱动采购动作的数值层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>供应链 ESG 风险区别于其他采购风险的地方在三点：<strong>风险发生在外部链路</strong>（你控制不了二级、三级供应商）、<strong>触发方式是监管而非市场</strong>（一张实体清单就能让整批货滞港）、<strong>证据是补不出来的</strong>（审计报告有有效期，历史行为没有）。这决定了它的工程形态是「信号采集 → 分类 → 分级 → 门控」的流水线，而不是一个打分类字段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采购链路与供应商主数据] --&gt; B[信号采集层]&#10;  B --&gt; C[监管清单命中&lt;br/&gt;UFLPA / 制裁名单]&#10;  B --&gt; D[商品-地理关联&lt;br/&gt;EUDR 地块坐标]&#10;  B --&gt; E[矿物溯源申报&lt;br/&gt;CMRT / 3TG]&#10;  B --&gt; F[排放核算数据&lt;br/&gt;Scope 1-2-3]&#10;  C --&gt; G[风险分类器&lt;br/&gt;四域归一化]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[分级评分&lt;br/&gt;严重度 + 等级]&#10;  H --&gt; I[采购门控&lt;br/&gt;准入 / 观察 / 阻断]&#10;  H --&gt; J[整改工单与复评周期]&#10;  J --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[采购链路与供应商主数据] --&gt; B[信号采集层]\n  B --&gt; C[监管清单命中&lt;br/&gt;UFLPA / 制裁名单]\n  B --&gt; D[商品-地理关联&lt;br/&gt;EUDR 地块坐标]\n  B --&gt; E[矿物溯源申报&lt;br/&gt;CMRT / 3TG]\n  B --&gt; F[排放核算数据&lt;br/&gt;Scope 1-2-3]\n  C --&gt; G[风险分类器&lt;br/&gt;四域归一化]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[分级评分&lt;br/&gt;严重度 + 等级]\n  H --&gt; I[采购门控&lt;br/&gt;准入 / 观察 / 阻断]\n  H --&gt; J[整改工单与复评周期]\n  J --&gt; G</pre><p>四类风险在同一个供应商上往往<strong>耦合</strong>：缅甸稀土矿区同时涉及冲突矿产、森林砍伐与强迫劳动；东南亚棕榈油供应链同时触发 EUDR 与劳工风险。分类的价值不是让它们互不干扰，而是让每个风险独立追溯到监管依据与证据源，从而在客户尽调或监管抽查时给出可辩护的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险域</th>\n<th>监管/标准锚点</th>\n<th>触发形态</th>\n<th>证据源</th>\n<th>复评周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强迫劳动</td>\n<td>UFLPA（美国）、EU 2024/3015（欧盟）</td>\n<td>实体清单命中 / 商品-产区推定</td>\n<td>实体清单、ILO 指标调查、审计</td>\n<td>清单变动即触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>森林砍伐</td>\n<td>EUDR (EU) 2023/1115</td>\n<td>地块坐标与 2020 基线比对</td>\n<td>地理坐标、卫星影像、合法来源证明</td>\n<td>年度 + 批次级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突矿产</td>\n<td>EU 2017/821、OECD 尽职调查指南</td>\n<td>3TG 进口商尽职调查缺口</td>\n<td>CMRT 申报、冶炼厂名单（RMAP）</td>\n<td>年度申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碳</td>\n<td>CBAM（EU，2026 起确定期）、GHG Protocol</td>\n<td>隐含碳强度与免费配额退出</td>\n<td>排放核算报告、核查意见</td>\n<td>年度 + 季度监测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四大风险域的监管坐标系\">四大风险域的监管坐标系</h2><p>分类不能凭空定义，必须以<strong>在生效或有明确生效日期的监管</strong>为锚。截至 2026 年，四个风险域的硬约束如下。</p>\n<p><strong>强迫劳动</strong>有两条并行法律线。美国方面，2021 年 12 月签署的《维吾尔强迫劳动预防法》（UFLPA）自 2022 年 6 月 21 日起实行<strong>可反驳推定</strong>：凡与新疆相关的货物一律推定使用强迫劳动，进口商须自证清白，否则扣留（<a href=\"https://www.dhs.gov/uflpa-entity-list\">DHS UFLPA Entity List</a>）。欧盟方面，Regulation (EU) 2024/3015 于 2024 年 12 月 12 日公布，禁止在欧盟市场投放或出口使用强迫劳动制造的产品，<strong>自 2027 年 12 月 14 日起适用</strong>，并责成欧盟委员会建立指示性的强迫劳动风险数据库（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202403015\">EUR-Lex L_202403015</a>）。其立法说明援引 ILO 的强迫劳动识别指标——扣留证件、债务束缚、限制行动、超时加班、克扣工资——正是审计问卷设计的直接来源。</p>\n<p><strong>森林砍伐</strong>由 EUDR 主导。Regulation (EU) 2023/1115 覆盖七类商品：棕榈油、牛、大豆、咖啡、可可、木材、橡胶及其衍生产品；核心义务是证明产品<strong>不来自 2020 年 12 月 31 日之后被砍伐的土地</strong>，并采集生产地块的地理坐标（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1115/oj\">EUR-Lex 2023/1115</a>）。违规罚款可达欧盟营业额的 4%。实施日期经多轮推迟：大中型企业自 2026 年 12 月 30 日起，微型与小型企业自 2027 年 6 月 30 日起。</p>\n<p><strong>冲突矿产</strong>是最早成型的域。OECD《受冲突影响和高风险地区矿产负责任供应链尽职调查指南》（2011 年首版，现行第三版）确立五步框架；欧盟据此发布 Regulation (EU) 2017/821，对**锡、钽、钨、金（3TG）**的欧盟进口商设定强制性供应链尽职调查义务（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L:2017:130:FULL\">EUR-Lex L:2017:130</a>）。美国一侧由 Dodd-Frank 法案第 1502 条经 SEC 规则落地。</p>\n<p><strong>碳</strong>的边界在 2026 年发生实质变化。欧盟碳边境调节机制（CBAM）在 2023–2025 年处于过渡期，<strong>自 2026 年 1 月 1 日起进入确定期</strong>：进口商需获授权、履行报告义务，并购买与缴纳对应隐含碳排放量的 CBAM 证书（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism_en\">欧盟税务与海关总署 CBAM</a>）。覆盖行业为水泥、钢铁、铝、化肥、电力与氢。CBAM 是四域中唯一<strong>以价格形式落地的风险</strong>——它不扣货，而是把排放成本写进到岸价。</p>\n<p>四条线的共同工程含义是：风险分类的<strong>版本必须跟随法规版本</strong>。EUDR 实施日期推迟过三次，CBAM 从过渡期切到确定期，CSDDD 在 2025 年 11 月又经历一轮削弱修订（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A02024L1760-20260318\">EUR-Lex 2024/1760 合并文本</a>）。硬编码生效日期的系统会周期性失准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级评分模型-从风险信号到可计算分数\">分级评分模型：从风险信号到可计算分数</h2><p>分类解决「是什么」，分级解决「有多严重」。可辩护的评分不是把四个维度加权平均——那是把不可比的东西强行相加。正确结构是<strong>每域内部先做严重度分级，域之间用布尔式门控而非线性加权</strong>，因为强迫劳动与碳成本在业务上不是同一种损失形态。</p>\n<p>单域严重度可这样建模：给定供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 在域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 上采集到的信号集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，每个信号有原始风险值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与衰减函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(d_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为信号年龄），域内取最严重信号而非平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i(s) = \\max_{k \\in K_i} \\; r_k \\cdot g(d_k), \\qquad g(d) = 2^{-d / \\tau_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2967em;vertical-align:-0.8522em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8522em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 的理由是<strong>一票否决</strong>性质：一个供应商有 99 条合规记录和 1 条强迫劳动指控，其强迫劳动风险仍然高，平均会把这条淹没。衰减常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按复评周期设定——冲突矿产申报约 1 年，CBAM 排放数据约 1 季度，实体清单命中则<strong>不衰减</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>），因为清单命中是状态而非时效信号。</p>\n<p>分级映射把连续分数切成业务可操作的档位，档位必须绑定<strong>动作</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>严重度区间</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>采购动作</th>\n<th>复评要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Critical</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i \\geq 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实体清单命中 / EUDR 地块落在砍伐区</td>\n<td>冻结新订单，评估存量货物</td>\n<td>解除前每 30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.7 \\leq R_i &lt; 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>未提交 CMRT / 冶炼厂不在 RMAP 名单</td>\n<td>暂停准入，存量限期整改</td>\n<td>每 90 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medium</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4 \\leq R_i &lt; 0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>审计发现 Major 缺陷 / 排放数据缺核查</td>\n<td>准入附加条件，入观察名单</td>\n<td>每 180 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i &lt; 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>证据齐备且无负面信号</td>\n<td>正常准入</td>\n<td>年度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨域聚合<strong>不做加权和</strong>，而取「最高可见等级 + 风险域计数」的二维表示：一个供应商可以是 <code>Critical×1, Medium×2</code>。采购经理看到的是结构化签名，而不是把强迫劳动与碳排放压扁成同一数字的伪精确分数。若要给客户披露合成分，仅在<strong>同一监管语境</strong>内合成——例如把 EUDR 与 CBAM 合成「欧盟市场准入风险」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多层级供应链的风险传导\">多层级供应链的风险传导</h2><p>真正的难点在于风险不发生在直接供应商身上，而在二级、三级。跨境链路通常有 Tier 1（成品组装）、Tier 2（部件）、Tier 3（原材料/冶炼），监管义务往往落在 Tier 3——3TG 在冶炼厂、棕榈油在种植园。</p>\n<p>传导模型的核心思想是：<strong>下游感知到的风险是上游风险的传播，但传播会衰减</strong>。设供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的直接风险为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其供应商集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则传播后的有效风险为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i^{\\text{eff}}(s) = \\max\\left( R_i(s), \\; \\alpha \\cdot \\max_{u \\in U(s)} R_i^{\\text{eff}}(u) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.416em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>归因衰减系数</strong>，反映「我能主张的可见度」。一级供应商的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 可接近 1；深到 Tier 4 以上时可见度低、证据弱，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 应显著小于 1，否则会把整个行业的风险都归到一家头上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T3[种植园 / 冶炼厂&lt;br/&gt;Tier 3-4] --&gt;|地理与矿物信号| T2[部件与原料&lt;br/&gt;Tier 2]&#10;  T2 --&gt;|加工与用工信号| T1[成品组装&lt;br/&gt;Tier 1]&#10;  T1 --&gt;|采购关系| ME[本企业]&#10;  ME --&gt;|法规义务| REG{风险域}&#10;  REG --&gt;|UFLPA| FREEZE[扣货风险]&#10;  REG --&gt;|EUDR| FINE[4% 营业额罚款]&#10;  REG --&gt;|CBAM| COST[碳成本入价]&#10;  REG --&gt;|CSDDD| LIAB[民事赔偿责任]\">flowchart TD\n  T3[种植园 / 冶炼厂&lt;br/&gt;Tier 3-4] --&gt;|地理与矿物信号| T2[部件与原料&lt;br/&gt;Tier 2]\n  T2 --&gt;|加工与用工信号| T1[成品组装&lt;br/&gt;Tier 1]\n  T1 --&gt;|采购关系| ME[本企业]\n  ME --&gt;|法规义务| REG{风险域}\n  REG --&gt;|UFLPA| FREEZE[扣货风险]\n  REG --&gt;|EUDR| FINE[4% 营业额罚款]\n  REG --&gt;|CBAM| COST[碳成本入价]\n  REG --&gt;|CSDDD| LIAB[民事赔偿责任]</pre><p>有个反直觉的工程要点：<strong>可见度衰减应显式建模并对外披露</strong>。与其假装算出了 Tier 4 的真实风险，不如在数据模型里保留 <code>visibility</code> 字段（<code>unknown / declared / verified</code>），让下游知道分数置信度。监管尽调问的往往是「你怎么知道」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号采集的数据工程\">信号采集的数据工程</h2><p>评分模型再漂亮，没有可复现的信号源就是空的。</p>\n<p><strong>实体清单匹配</strong>是文本问题而非数据问题。UFLPA 清单含大量中文企业名与别名（aliases），等值匹配会漏掉「Hetian Haolin Hair Accessories Co. Ltd.」与其别名的关联。工程上需保留别名并建索引、对供应商名做规范化（去后缀、简繁折叠、拼音辅助）、记录每次命中的<strong>证据快照</strong>（哪一版清单、命中哪个字段、命中时间）。</p>\n<p><strong>EUDR 地块坐标</strong>是地理数据问题：系统要能存点/多边形坐标并与全球森林变化数据做空间比对，且要与<strong>商品批次</strong>而非供应商绑定——同一供应商在不同地块的合规状态可能不同。</p>\n<p><strong>冲突矿产申报</strong>依赖标准化模板。行业通用的 CMRT（Conflict Minerals Reporting Template，由 RMI 维护）逐级汇总至冶炼厂层级，工程约束是<strong>申报为年度快照</strong>且大量供应商未回应，系统必须区分「申报显示无 3TG」与「未申报」——前者是证据，后者是缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>碳数据</strong>采集深度取决于 CBAM 要求：进口商需要生产设施的<strong>实测隐含排放</strong>而非行业平均值，这要求供应商提供经核查的排放报告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>供应链 ESG 风险必须<strong>先分类后分级</strong>：四域各有独立监管锚点，强行加权平均会淹没一票否决类风险。</li>\n<li>分类锚点是<strong>有明确生效日期的法规</strong>且版本必须跟随——EUDR 推迟过三次、CBAM 2026 年切入确定期、CSDDD 2025 年修订。</li>\n<li>域内严重度用 <code>max</code> 而非平均，配以按复评周期设定的衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；实体清单命中不衰减。</li>\n<li>跨域聚合用「最高等级 + 域计数」二维签名，避免伪精确合成分。</li>\n<li>多层级传导必须显式建模归因衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与可见度置信度，否则会产生误报或掩盖真实缺口。</li>\n<li>四类信号源各有工程特殊性：实体清单是文本别名匹配、EUDR 是空间数据、3TG 是年度申报快照、碳是实测排放。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文讨论风险域的划分与评分数值化。评分口径与第三方审计结果的归一化见同章 <a href=\"../esg-supplier-qualification-data/thirdparty-esg-audit-scoring\">第三方 ESG 审计与评分归一化</a>；供应商 ESG 数据字段见 <a href=\"../esg-supplier-qualification-data/supplier-esg-profile-data-model\">供应商 ESG 档案数据模型</a>；多元供应商认定见 <a href=\"../diversity-spend-program/diverse-supplier-certification-classification\">多元供应商认证与分类</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分（强迫劳动/森林砍伐/冲突矿产/碳）","id":"供应链-esg-风险分类与分级评分-强迫劳动-森林砍伐-冲突矿产-碳"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四大风险域的监管坐标系","id":"四大风险域的监管坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"分级评分模型：从风险信号到可计算分数","id":"分级评分模型-从风险信号到可计算分数"},{"level":2,"text":"多层级供应链的风险传导","id":"多层级供应链的风险传导"},{"level":2,"text":"信号采集的数据工程","id":"信号采集的数据工程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多元化目标设定、激励与供应商准入/培育机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/diversity-spend-program/diversity-target-incentive-enrollment"},"next":{"title":"供应链溯源与 N 级映射（BOM 穿透、冶炼厂/产地级追溯）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/supply-chain-traceability-ntier"}}